WEBVTT

00:01:56.980 --> 00:01:58.680
<i>Dearest Grandmother...</i>

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:03.390
<i>Spring has returned to Saotome Academy.</i>

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:12.150
<i>Since that miraculous Uta Pri Award, 
things have been going well for STARISH.</i>

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:18.450
<i>I've been composing more, too.</i>

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:23.120
<i>We're still living in the Master Course dorm.</i>

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:28.920
<i>Every day, we're inspired by QUARTET NIGHT.</i>

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:31.560
Nanami!

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:34.660
Ittoki-kun.

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:37.920
Nanami.

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:39.100
Huh?

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:40.720
What?

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:44.070
This must be fate.

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:45.360
U-Um...

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:47.650
Sorry!

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:51.520
I was thinking I wanted to see you, 
and then you showed up...

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:53.520
Oh, right.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.480
Look at this.

00:02:58.060 --> 00:02:59.890
It just arrived.

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:02.380
I'm on my way to play it in the lesson room.

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:03.820
It was love at first sight.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.170
I had to have it.

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:09.380
I wanted to show you first.

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:13.960
I want you to hear me sing your song.

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:17.680
A heartfelt song just for you.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:19.700
You have no idea how much I—

00:03:22.850 --> 00:03:23.470
Nothing!

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:27.420
I'll work even harder with STARISH.

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:28.890
I look forward to working with you.

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:44.440
Shinomiya-san.

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.240
Haru-chan.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:52.160
I was just looking at something very cute.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:55.010
Something... cute?

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:56.420
Huh?

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.510
Look.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:04.780
How cute.

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:07.810
A fairy must have made it bloom.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:10.650
It's adorable.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.380
Just like you.

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:13.020
What?

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:15.490
I wish I could take you away.

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:22.960
To a place with endlessly falling 
cherry blossoms for just the two of us.

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:31.170
I'm glad we get to see cute things together.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:46.950
Fun with Japanese

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:46.200
Cecil-san.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:48.760
Haruka.

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:00.950
Haruka.

00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:05.440
Haruka, I'm so glad to see you.

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:09.030
Um... What were you doing in that tree?

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:10.310
Studying.

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:12.080
Studying?

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:19.090
Yes. The moon is very bright tonight, 
so I'm reading a Japanese textbook.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:23.170
You always study so hard.

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:25.120
Thank you, Haruka.

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:28.670
I've been wanting to thank you.

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:29.220
What?

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:34.430
The muses led me to your 
music and this country.

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:35.770
And...

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:41.150
I found wonderful friends to sing with.

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:43.940
It's all thanks to you.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:48.060
You are my darling princess.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:12.950
Jinguji-san...

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:26.240
That was wonderful.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:27.950
What was wonderful?

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:33.040
My performance or me?

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:33.900
What?

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:36.960
You're a naughty, little lamb.

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:40.040
You're always setting my heart on fire.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:43.090
The cherry blossoms and moon are beautiful,

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:45.800
but you're most beautiful of all, my lady.

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:50.840
Just looking at you rends my heart in two...

00:06:55.930 --> 00:07:00.340
I'm still waiting for you to grow up.

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:08.900
I love you!

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:11.970
I...

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:15.350
I love you!

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:17.830
Nanami?

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:20.490
Were you listening?

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:21.660
Y-Yes...

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:26.540
They're just lines for my movie.

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:27.840
You mean...

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:28.710
Yeah.

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:34.170
It's called <i>Prince of Fighting: Iron Fists 
Ten Thousand Meters Under the Sea!</i>

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:37.060
I'm performing with Hyuga-sensei again!

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:38.680
That's incredible!

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:41.580
I've got a lot of lines.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:43.920
There's even more action, too.

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:47.540
A-And I have a love scene...

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:50.530
That's what you were practicing.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.490
Yeah. Watch this.

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:59.510
The sky may fall and the earth may shatter, 
but my feelings will never change.

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:01.790
Until the end of time, I...

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:01.320
Um...

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.670
I will protect you.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:12.520
Sorry!

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:15.430
I know it'll be great.

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:16.630
I'm sure.

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:18.640
Do your best.

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:21.530
Yeah! You can count on me!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:51.270
I am flooded with feelings of love.

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:57.390
I will never stop singing my love for you.

00:08:58.130 --> 00:08:59.890
Hijirikawa-san...

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:04.830
Is that really you, Nanami?

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:07.100
What? Y-Yes.

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:13.130
I thought it was an illusion 
of the passions in my heart.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:14.390
What?

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:16.670
Nothing...

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:35.550
I-I'm sorry to have bothered you.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:36.250
It's fine.

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:38.190
I should go.

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:38.740
All right.

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:50.050
On this night, the lovely cherry blossoms fall. 
It's a miracle that we met.

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:56.820
It's beautiful.

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:14.240
You're unbelievable.

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:15.940
Ichinose-san...

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:20.910
Why can't you be more careful?

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:23.310
I-I'm sorry!

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:29.920
I had a feeling I'd meet you here, 
so I was keeping an eye out.

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.020
I'm sorry...

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:47.330
Don't.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:48.000
What?

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.600
Don't bump into anyone but me.

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:57.010
Be careful.

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:58.630
O-Okay...

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:04.710
<i>I'm running into everyone tonight.</i>

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:07.450
<i>What a strange night...</i>

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:45.400
Ignorant girl.

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:49.600
How dare you stare at me.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:52.230
I'm sorry.

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:57.470
Um... You were just so beautiful, 
like a European painting.

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:08.760
You've...

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:12.870
...got a good eye.

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:13.910
What?

00:12:16.490 --> 00:12:18.090
Don't take it so seriously.

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:45.790
Mikaze-senpai.

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:47.780
It's you.

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:51.700
Sorry for bothering you.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.000
Will you teach me?

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:56.070
What?

00:12:56.070 --> 00:13:01.670
When I sing the song you wrote, 
my chest pounds.

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:07.140
It's odd.

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:09.510
This doesn't happen with other songs.

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:14.510
You know why, don't you?

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:20.770
Um...

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:24.040
I see.

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:26.730
You don't know.

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:32.860
I'll think about it tonight.

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:52.060
Kurosaki-senpai.

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:57.440
Um...

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:03.650
Excuse me.

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:09.150
What?

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:18.920
Um...

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.430
Don't move.

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:27.070
What?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.320
The cherry blossoms are blooming.

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:42.600
Yes, they're in full bloom.

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:49.190
I didn't notice.

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:01.250
Hey, kiddo. Welcome back.

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:05.780
Kotobuki-senpai.

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.090
Good work.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:09.560
You, too.

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:13.250
You're hard at work nearly every day.

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:15.470
Thank you.

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:18.430
You're a shining young lady.

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:23.270
The way you always shine 
sets my heart pounding.

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:24.700
I-I see...

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:28.410
But you could shine even more.

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:31.610
I'll show you how.

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:32.710
What?

00:15:33.270 --> 00:15:34.070
Come on.

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:40.290
Let's enter the world of adults together.

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:49.340
Sorry, sorry.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.150
You'll learn soon enough.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:54.280
Kaboom.

00:15:56.210 --> 00:15:57.030
Later.

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:05.170
<i>Grandmother, tonight 
really is a strange night.</i>

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:11.500
<i>I feel as though something 
new is about to begin...</i>

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:20.940
Haruka!

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.420
I've been waiting for you.

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:24.560
Welcome back.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:27.880
Tomo-chan!

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:30.210
What are you doing here?

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:32.490
I was in Hokkaido for a shoot.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:34.220
Ta-da. This is for you.

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:37.650
I thought we could share them.

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:38.710
Thanks.

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:44.020
Sorry we're late.

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.020
Guys.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:47.700
What are you all doing here?

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:55.370
This again?

00:16:58.870 --> 00:16:59.960
Cherry blossoms?

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:10.200
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:24.810
It's the president...

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:29.730
Good morning, nighttime!

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:37.410
Ringo-sensei, Hyuga-sensei.

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:42.510
Everyone's here.

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:43.870
So...

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:50.130
I have an important announcement!

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:52.050
An important announcement?

00:17:52.470 --> 00:17:56.830
I'm sure you know, but the International 
Sports Festival is coming up.

00:17:58.030 --> 00:18:00.620
Super Star Sports!

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:02.560
Triple S, for short.

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:11.270
The world's favorite tournament 
is being held in Japan this year.

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:16.650
One of the host nation's artists 
begins the opening ceremony every year.

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:20.030
The opening ceremony is broadcast 
simultaneously around the world.

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:21.990
The whole world will be watching.

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:27.420
We will submit as candidates...

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.890
Kotobuki Reiji!

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:36.650
Kurosaki Ranmaru!

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:38.780
Mikaze Ai!

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:41.270
And Camus!

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:45.220
These four! In other words...

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:48.020
QUARTET NIGHT!

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:55.530
Finally, Miss Nanami...

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:57.070
Y-Yes, sir.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:19:00.320
I want you to write...

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:05.830
...QUARTET NIGHT's song.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:07.060
What?

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:10.170
I told you, kiddo.

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:13.880
This is how you'll grow up.

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:17.840
Um...

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:21.400
Anyway, we're counting on you.

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:24.710
I look forward to working with you.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:27.200
That's all!

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:30.130
Important announcement over!

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:34.940
Haruka, that's great!

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:37.440
Nanami, you can do it.

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.900
We're rooting for you.

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:41.210
Okay.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:42.360
Thanks, everyone!

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:43.910
I'll do my best!

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:53.830
Singing at the Triple S 
opening ceremony must be amazing.

00:19:54.530 --> 00:20:00.860
I've been watching since I was a kid, 
but the opening song is always exciting.

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:06.600
Yeah. The event is about the athletes, 
but the song's just as important.

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:10.480
A simultaneous world broadcast...

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:13.060
It would be a world debut.

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:17.300
That's wonderful for Haru-chan 
and the upperclassmen.

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:21.380
Indeed. I hope we can achieve that someday.

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:23.070
When?

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:26.410
When's the next one?

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:27.450
What?

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:31.830
I'd like to sing at the next Triple S.

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:37.980
Cesshi, another country's 
hosting the next one.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:39.670
We can't perform.

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:43.010
Then when will our "someday" be?

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:54.850
Nanami!

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.400
Huh?

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:01.790
Come with us.

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:02.590
What?

00:21:02.590 --> 00:21:04.570
Let's go!

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:07.060
What?!

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:10.410
President!

00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:16.960
What do you want?

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:21.320
Will you enter STARISH in the Triple S?

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:27.850
At first, we thought we'd perform someday.

00:21:28.340 --> 00:21:30.100
But there is no someday.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:32.020
Only now.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:34.980
We won't get a second chance.

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:39.440
We want the entire world to hear us sing.

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:41.540
We want to perform.

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:44.440
Our someday is now.

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:49.290
Is that all?

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:58.290
I can't enter you into the Triple S.

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:08.830
Do you understand what 
it means to enter the Triple S?

00:22:09.990 --> 00:22:10.800
Well...

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:13.110
B-But we—

00:22:13.590 --> 00:22:16.770
Revolution!

00:22:19.010 --> 00:22:20.230
Revolution?

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:21.690
Revolution...

00:22:22.050 --> 00:22:23.150
Revolution?

00:22:23.420 --> 00:22:24.610
Revolution?

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:26.070
Revolution.

00:22:26.330 --> 00:22:27.530
Revolution...

00:22:27.800 --> 00:22:28.990
Revolution?

00:22:30.090 --> 00:22:31.950
Revolution?

00:22:33.610 --> 00:22:35.130
Revolution?

00:24:06.570 --> 00:24:09.710
Come on and "Revolution" with us!

00:24:09.710 --> 00:24:10.710
Uta Pri!
